cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NNLCI, please cite this software and the relevant papers listed in the README."
type: software
title: "NNLCI: Neural Networks with Local Converging Inputs"
abstract: >-
  NNLCI is a data-centric framework for reconstructing high-fidelity flow
  fields from local, physics-bearing low-fidelity inputs, with particular
  strength in shock-wave and strong-gradient problems.
authors:
